        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Everything went very well from start to finish for repairing my Tesla after hitting a deer.  Audrey was very helpful, the courtesy car was fine, the work was completed in good time and professionally.  They handled everything with the insurance company.  Highly recommend.",
        "time": 1756998168,
