        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Great place. Did great job on my car. Everyone is profesional and everything was so easy and no stress.",
        "time": 1764911736,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Serge Chenier",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111604588864811074607/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ6W1SFIRUFukEa1ngnzbV8qp9V9CWeJdnhXmDr-ktt0nqLGw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Went there with my brand new ford maverick 2023 with damage .the left hand side rear was accidented..Because my insurance was to repair it with brand new parts it was for me important that my truck came out looking brand new again.The welcoming team which are audrie Andreann  and all the rest of the staff at that location gave me a welcome that I will not forget.They were amazing.I was treated like a personnalité.All questions answered and I was there everyday to check my truck and I could go look at the progress in wip at all time.I was so happy that I got them donuts for the whole team lol.Respect and they will give you the same in return.I will go there again for any issues that could happened.They even fix my daughter suv at the same time.That kind of service is for me very hard to get today.Thank you Procolor team.You made my day when I got my vehicle back.Keep up the fantastic work",
        "time": 1700398783,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Amine Kabene",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118037100246133992446/reviews",
        "language": "en",
